Conclusion
This investigation demonstrated my ability to collect, analyze, and interpret Windows security events using native security tools and Sysmon. I successfully validated authentication auditing, monitored process creation activity, and used PowerShell to efficiently retrieve security logs. Based on the evidence collected, I found no indicators of compromise or unauthorized access. All observed activity was consistent with normal system operations and controlled testing.

This project strengthened my understanding of Windows security monitoring and reflects skills commonly used by SOC Analysts, Cybersecurity Analysts, and Incident Response teams.

